/* EDBG_BOOTLOAD_FORCE_DOWNLOAD
 * linkage: own-page (1 statement(s), e.g. corpus/chm/windows-ce-3.0/_wcepb_EDBG_BOOTME_DATA.html)
 * row (table): EDBG_BOOTLOAD_FORCE_DOWNLOAD 0x0001 Forces Eshell.exe to download a new image, regardless of the user's settings in the Options menu. Useful if a bootloader determines that the image currently loaded into flash is not present or is corrupt, for example.
 * source: corpus/chm/windows-ce-3.0/_wcepb_EDBG_BOOTME_DATA.html
